        (i)  the free khronon tail T-hat == 0 (conformal class: contact + thermal ONLY);
        (ii) the (a,H)-dependence beyond kappa is an AMPLITUDE factor, ANALYTIC in a^2
             and O(1/c_chi^2)-suppressed -- V's a->0 analyticity wall is OBEYED, not evaded;
        (iii) the free khronon sits INSIDE agentF's KMS census: it cannot source mu.
